     *
     * Original C:
     *   B[r][s] = 0;
     *   for (t = 0; t < n; ++t)
     *     for (r = 0; r < n; ++r)
     *       for (s = 0; s < n; ++s)
     *         B[r][s] += A[r][t] * A[s][t];
     *   A[r][s] = B[r][s];
     *
     * Here B = A * A^T where A is n x n lower-triangular.
     *
     * With mapping A(j, i) == A[i][j]:
     *   A[r][t] -> A_param(t, r)
     *   A[s][t] -> A_param(t, s)
     *   B[r][s] -> B_func(s, r)
